    gross_income expects answers ["the gross income of hana is 650"].
    disposable_income expects answers ["the disposable income of hana is 305"].
    disposable_capital expects answers ["the disposable capital of hana is 6200"].
    income_contribution expects answers ["the assessed monthly income contribution of hana is 0"].
    capital_contribution expects answers ["the assessed capital contribution of hana is 2500"].
    capital_contribution_payable expects answers ["the capital contribution payable by hana is 0"].

% 7. Passported on income, but over the capital limit; a Windrush payment is
% disregarded.
scenario passported_over_capital is:
    ivan is a client.
    ivan applies for "legal representation".
    the age of ivan is 38.
    ivan is properly in receipt directly or indirectly of "universal credit".
    ivan holds 9000 as "savings".
    ivan holds 20000 as "Windrush compensation".
    result expects answers ["the means test result of ivan is not eligible: disposable capital over the limit under regulation 6(4)(a)"].
    eligible expects answers [].
    disposable_capital expects answers ["the disposable capital of ivan is 9000"].
    income_contribution expects answers ["the assessed monthly income contribution of ivan is 0"].
    capital_contribution expects answers ["the assessed capital contribution of ivan is 0"].

% 8. A pensioner with a low income keeps savings and a home thanks to the
